==English==

===Etymology===
From the act of [[tying]] or even [[nail]]ing a pigeon to a stool to act as a [[decoy]] for hunters.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[stool]] [[pigeon]]}}

# {{context|slang|lang=en}} A decoy or an [[informer]], especially one who is a [[spy]] for the police.

====Synonyms====
* [[stoolie]]/[[stooly]]
* See also [[Wikisaurus:informant]]
2. Taking the FALL. Being used by criminals to escape misconduct, usually unknowingly, as in a 'Sitting DUCK'.
      Synonyms:
      "FALL Guy".
Being set-up or FRAMED.
